  "purpose": "Preserve and ingest official LEGO browser/web-game visual references that are absent from commercial game catalogs.",
  "scope_rules": [
    "A web game must be shown to have been published/commissioned by LEGO or hosted in an official LEGO web property before its assets become official-corpus evidence.",
    "Community archives and wikis are discovery/preservation sources, not style authorities.",
    "Standard minifigure-form assets feed the main corpus; BIONICLE, Hero Factory, minidoll and other systems get separate form profiles.",
    "Use original local game assets where preserved; use screenshots only when source assets cannot be decoded."
  ],
